%% Target alpha architecture; components are not all implemented.
flowchart LR
  H[Human user] --> W[Next.js console]
  X[External agent] --> MCP[MCP server]
  W --> APP[Shared application services and policy checks]
  MCP --> APP
  APP --> AUTH[Supabase Auth]
  APP --> CP[Supabase Postgres identity, workflow ledger, and durable jobs]
  APP --> G[(FalkorDB Cloud graph per workspace)]
  APP --> SRC[Selected source adapters: GitHub, cloud deployment, fraud cases, security findings]
  JOB[Host-scheduled Bun worker] --> CP
  CP -->|outbox events| JOB
  JOB --> APP
  APP --> LLM[LLM provider]
  JOB --> LLM
  APP -->|propose; await approval| ACT[GitHub and cloud action adapters]
  H -->|approve exact proposal| APP
  ACT -->|observed result| APP
  APP --> G
  JOB -->|graph projection| G
  G -->|source evidence, provenance, graph projections| APP

  subgraph Governing_rules
    ID[Server-derived tenant and agent identity]
    ACL[Per-node, edge, source and history access checks]
    TRUST[Provenance and trust review]
    DEL[Forgetting blocks derived live content and active runs]
  end
  APP -.-> ID
  APP -.-> ACL
  APP -.-> TRUST
  APP -.-> DEL
